	<string>This app needs access to update your health data for step tracking functionality.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>앱 사용 중에 위치 정보를 활용</string>
	<key>NSMotionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>This app uses motion sensors to track your steps and physical activity.</string>
